-- 0001_initial_draft.sql
-- Seeds the CMS with the current public website content as DRAFT records.
-- Source: index.html in this repository (the production page), read with a DOM parser.
-- Repeatable: every insert uses fixed IDs and ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so running it again
-- creates no duplicates and never overwrites edits made later in the dashboard.
-- This file does not publish anything. The live site is unchanged by running it.

