go-to-market owned; 30% fuel sales increase within 6 months of launch.","strong":false}]}]},{"title":"Cost & Efficiency","points":[{"text":"30% OPEX reduction, USD 3.6M+ saved annually — renegotiated 15+ vendor contracts, rebuilt SOPs across all 90 stations, deployed process automation tracked on a live cost-per-station dashboard.","segments":[{"text":"30% OPEX reduction, USD 3.6M+ saved annually","strong":true},{"text":"— renegotiated 15+ vendor contracts, rebuilt SOPs across all 90 stations, deployed process automation tracked on a live cost-per-station dashboard.","strong":false}]},{"text":"58% stock loss eliminated — rebuilt inventory governance under live 20M litre/month operating load without disrupting throughput.","segments":[{"text":"58% stock loss eliminated","strong":true},{"text":"— rebuilt inventory governance under live 20M litre/month operating load without disrupting throughput.","strong":false}]},{"text":"40% operational efficiency gain post-ERP — Forecourt Automation, Auto-Indenting, and Audit Management directed across all 90 stations; gains measured via pre/post KPI dashboards.","segments":[{"text":"40% operational efficiency gain post-ERP","strong":true},{"text":"— Forecourt Automation, Auto-Indenting, and Audit Management directed across all 90 stations; gains measured via pre/post KPI dashboards.","strong":false}]}]},{"title":"Expansion & Scale","points":[{"text":"16 greenfield stations commissioned on schedule — zero post-handover compliance failures; full ownership from site evaluation through CAPEX, regulatory approvals, staffing, and commissioning.","segments":[{"text":"16 greenfield stations commissioned on schedule","strong":true},{"text":"— zero post-handover compliance failures; full ownership from site evaluation through CAPEX, regulatory approvals, staffing, and commissioning.","strong":false}]},{"text":"Company-wide KPI scorecard and real-time dashboard — shifted 90-station management from reactive to data-driven across commercial, financial, and operational targets.","segments":[{"text":"Company-wide KPI scorecard and real-time dashboard","strong":true},{"text":"— shifted 90-station management from reactive to data-driven across commercial, financial, and operational targets.","strong":false}]},{"text":"1,200+ people led across Ops, Sales, Finance, HR, and Compliance — 100% regulatory compliance maintained throughout.","segments":[{"text":"1,200+ people led","strong":true},{"text":"across Ops, Sales, Finance, HR, and Compliance — 100% regulatory compliance maintained throughout.","strong":false}]},{"text":"Fuel e-commerce channel built from zero — 500M litres annual volume — established new digital revenue channel and operational model over a 24-month period.","segments":[{"text":"Fuel e-commerce channel built from zero — 500M litres annual volume","strong":true},{"text":"— established new digital revenue channel and operational model over a 24-month period.","strong":false}]},{"text":"Supply chain and distribution directed for six months — zero dry-outs across all retail stations; uninterrupted on-time delivery for commercial (B2B) and mining customers under full operating load.","segments":[{"text":"Supply chain and distribution directed for six months","strong":true},{"text":"— zero dry-outs across all retail stations; uninterrupted on-time delivery for commercial (B2B) and mining customers under full operating load.","strong":false}]},{"text":"2 million-litre city fuel depot commissioned end-to-end — from team build-out and capability design through to full operational readiness and throughput stabilisation.","segments":[{"text":"2 million-litre city fuel depot commissioned end-to-end","strong":true},{"text":"— from team build-out and capability design through to full operational readiness and throughput stabilisation.","strong":false}]}]},{"title":"AI & Data-Led Operations","points":[{"text":"Integrated practical AI applications into daily sales and operational workflows — supporting demand forecasting, decision support, and performance tracking at network level.","segments":[{"text":"Integrated practical AI applications into daily sales and operational workflows","strong":true},{"text":"— supporting demand forecasting, decision support, and performance tracking at network level.","strong":false}]},{"text":"Applied selectively to enhance speed and accuracy of execution without introducing dependency — improving responsiveness across commercial and operational decisions.","segments":[{"text":"Applied selectively to","strong":false},{"text":"enhance speed and accuracy of execution without introducing dependency","strong":true},{"text":"— improving responsiveness across commercial and operational decisions.","strong":false}]}]}]$j$::jsonb, true, $t$p-mmp$t$, 2)
